ParentVault_initialize
  ├── when initialization succeeds
  │   ├── it should set parent vault state
  │   ├── it should grant CANCEL_DEPOSIT_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   ├── it should grant ALLOWLIST_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   ├── it should initialize empty membership with enforcement enabled or disabled
  │   └── it should emit AllowlistEnabledSet
  ├── when treasury is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when cancel deposit operator is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  └── when allowlist operator is the zero address
      └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
